; The reduced 3DS material model's skinned lit vertex (RFC 0026 decision 8,
; render/material/surface_reduced.h): a model draw handed over with its
; bones (CoreMeshDraw::bonePalette) instead of skinned on the CPU. Linked
; with lit_bones_main.pica, model_lighting.pica and skin.pica, in that
; order: c0-c3 world-to-clip rows, c4-c7 the object-to-world slot (unused),
; c8-c34 ModelLighting, c35-c91 the bone palette. The vertex: v0 the
; position and v1 the normal in bone space, v3 the uv, v4 the weights and
; v5 the palette offsets (skin.pica), from SurfaceWorldVertex with its bone
; meaning or from the frontend's buffers (CoreMeshStreams). Out as
; surface_lit.v.pica.
